  "description": "Protect your Chrysler Pacifica's interior with OEDRO Custom Fit Floor Mats, engineered for families who need reliable protection every day. Designed using advanced 3D laser scanning technology, these floor liners precisely follow the contours of your vehicle’s footwell, delivering edge-to-edge coverage while maintaining a factory-style fit.\nMade from premium odorless TPE material, OEDRO all-weather floor mats are built to handle rain, snow, mud, dirt, and everyday spills. The durable yet flexible design provides long-lasting protection without sacrificing comfort or style. Whether you're driving kids to school, taking road trips, or managing daily commutes, these floor liners help keep your Pacifica clean, protected, and easy to maintain.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Maximum Coverage: Precision-designed with 3D scanning technology to perfectly match your vehicle’s floor contours, providing edge-to-edge protection.\nAll-Weather Protection: Built to handle rain, snow, mud, and spills, keeping your carpet clean and dry in any condition.\nDurable & Flexible Material: Made from high-quality TPE material that resists wear while remaining flexible and comfortable for daily use.\nEasy to Clean & Maintain: Simply remove and rinse with water or wipe clean—no special tools or effort required.\nOdorless & Interior-Friendly: Designed with a non-toxic, odor-free material that keeps your cabin environment fresh and safe for you and your passengers.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible for 2017-2026 Chrysler Pacifica (No Hybrid Models), Fit 7 and 8 Passenger Models.\nNo Hybrid Models\nFit to 2nd Row Bucket Seating\nNot fit to 2nd Row Bench Seating",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
    "Made from eco-friendly TPE material that is odorless, durable, and flexible, offering long-lasting performance while remaining safe for family use and extreme temperatures.",
    "Waterproof surface allows quick rinse or wipe cleaning, while anti-slip texture and secure fit system keep mats stable and firmly in place during daily driving."
  ],
